         2 | Daria Kuznetsova | Hyundai Solaris       | Welcome Promo |      38 |  17 |  224.20 |  224.20
         3 | Sofia Kozlova    | Mercedes-Benz V-Class | Minivan       |     220 | 260 | 3410.00 | 3410.00
         4 | Anna Smirnova    | Skoda Octavia         | Comfort       |      43 |  31 |  580.50 |  580.50
         5 | Nikita Lebedev   | Kia Rio               | Economy       |      42 |  26 |  415.80 |  415.80
         6 | Egor Popov       | Volkswagen Polo       | Welcome Promo |      50 |  40 |  295.00 |  295.00
         7 | Maxim Sokolov    | Kia Rio               | Economy       |      90 | 110 |  891.00 |  891.00
         8 | Boris Ivanov     | Skoda Octavia         | Comfort       |      45 |  36 |  607.50 |  607.50
         9 | Irina Volkova    | Hyundai Solaris       | Economy       |      25 |  18 |  247.50 |  247.50
        11 | Pavel Novikov    | Kia Rio               | Welcome Promo |      42 |  31 |  247.80 |  247.80
        12 | Daria Kuznetsova | Skoda Octavia         | Comfort       |      47 |  32 |  634.50 |  634.50
